        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The parties may also jointly petition the PEBB to continue to do as follows: Employees who live in counties where the PEBB considers there to be an insufficient number of preferred providers within the PPO network will receive the same level of benefits when they use a non-preferred provider as they would using a preferred provider.",
